---
name: reflect
description: Run a reflection pass — read the friction, failures and owner feedback logged since the last pass, find what keeps recurring, and turn it into small tested workflow fixes (applied directly when safe, proposed to the owner otherwise). Load it when the owner asks to reflect, when a failure nudge suggests a pass, or when friction has piled up — at a natural stopping point, never mid-task.
